# Amrikyy-AIOS Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values

# API Key for external services (required for production deployment)
# This should be prefixed with VITE_ to be available in the Vite build
VITE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Optional: Application name (default: Amrikyy-AIOS)
# VITE_APP_NAME=Amrikyy-AIOS

# Optional: Application version (automatically set during deployment)
# VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0

# Note: In Vite, only environment variables prefixed with VITE_ are 
# exposed to your client-side code. This is a security feature to 
# prevent accidentally exposing sensitive server-side variables.
#
# For local development:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local
# 2. Replace placeholder values with your actual API keys
# 3. Never commit .env.local to version control
#
# For production deployment:
# - Set these as GitHub Secrets (for GitHub Actions deployment)
# - Set these as substitution variables (for Cloud Build deployment)
# - See deployment-guide.md for detailed instructions
